Kadllm

Kadllm provides WideTuning for model adaptation and GRBeam for shared-prefix
beam decoding and inference kernels.

The Triton gated-delta kernel includes code derived from flash-linear-attention:
https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention
Copyright (c) 2023-2026 Songlin Yang, Yu Zhang, Zhiyuan Li
MIT license: licenses/flash-linear-attention-MIT.txt

The local modification reads the initial state by request index instead of
beam index and omits final-state writes. The upstream authors do not endorse
this package. The upstream dependency's current source is not needed at runtime.

Optional FlashAttention is an external dependency, not vendored code:
https://github.com/Dao-AILab/flash-attention

This release contains mathematical building blocks, random-weight examples,
and benchmark runners. It includes no pretrained weights or application data.

The model-specific Qwen3.5 adapter follows projection and layer ordering from
Hugging Face Transformers Qwen3.5 (Apache-2.0).
Copyright 2025 The Qwen Team and The HuggingFace Inc. team.
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.8.1/src/transformers/models/qwen3_5
License: licenses/transformers-Apache-2.0.txt
Modifications provide immutable request-sized prefix storage and route suffix
replay through GRBeam operators, with independently selectable backends.
